Did you remember to press F3 to call for Pumpy?

Did you pick up Pumpy and put the end of his hose over the tiny box
and press the space bar?

If Pumpy somehow isn't showing a 'B' for bigger on his button then
click on his button until it does.

If you made the box bigger than you want, then click on Pumpy's button
until you get to 'L' for little.

